#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Setup instructions for using IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud to submit Qiskit SDK "
"and Qiskit Runtime jobs by using the REST API"
msgstr ""
"Istruzioni di configurazione per utilizzare IBM Quantum su IBM Cloud per "
"inviare job con Qiskit SDK e Qiskit Runtime tramite la REST API"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API"
msgstr "Configurazione per utilizzare IBM Quantum Platform con la REST API"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore urlencoded, WQVY */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API {#set-up-to-use-ibm-"
"quantum-platform-with-rest-api}"
msgstr ""
"Configurazione per utilizzare IBM Quantum Platform con la REST API {#set-up-"
"to-use-ibm-quantum-platform-with-rest-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can access quantum processors with REST APIs, enabling you to work with "
"QPUs using any programming language or framework.\n"
msgstr ""
"Puoi accedere ai processori quantistici tramite le REST API, permettendoti "
"di lavorare con le QPU usando qualsiasi linguaggio di programmazione o "
"framework.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Get access {#1-get-access}"
msgstr "1. Ottieni l'accesso {#1-get-access}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not already have a user account, get one at the [IBM Quantum login"
" page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/login).\n"
msgstr ""
"Se non hai già un account utente, creane uno dalla [pagina di accesso a IBM "
"Quantum](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/login).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an API key (also called a token) on the "
"[dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Note that the same API key can "
"be used for either region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Crea una chiave API (chiamata anche token) nella "
"[dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Tieni presente che la stessa "
"chiave API può essere utilizzata per entrambe le regioni.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. Generate an IBM Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM) bearer token. This is a short-lived token  used to authenticate requests to the REST API. To generate one, call the [IAM Identity Services API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/iam-identity-token-api#create-api-key) as shown in the following sample request:\n"
"<Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"1. Genera un bearer token di IBM Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM). Si tratta di un token a breve durata utilizzato per autenticare le richieste alla REST API. Per generarne uno, chiama la [IAM Identity Services API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/iam-identity-token-api#create-api-key) come mostrato nella seguente richiesta di esempio:\n"
"<Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   <TabItem value=\"Curl\" label=\"Curl\">\n"
msgstr "   <TabItem value=\"Curl\" label=\"Curl\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   Expected Response\n"
msgstr "   Risposta attesa\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   </TabItem>\n"
msgstr "   </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "   <TabItem value=\"Python\" label=\"Python\">\n"
msgstr "   <TabItem value=\"Python\" label=\"Python\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"   </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. Choose an authentication method {#2-choose-an-authentication-method}"
msgstr ""
"2. Scegli un metodo di autenticazione {#2-choose-an-authentication-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Choose the appropriate authentication method, depending on your working "
"environment:\n"
msgstr ""
"Scegli il metodo di autenticazione appropriato in base al tuo ambiente di "
"lavoro:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create an environment variable for your API key (trusted Python "
"environments)](#environment_variable)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crea una variabile d'ambiente per la tua chiave API (ambienti Python "
"affidabili)](#environment_variable)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Use your API key directly (untrusted environment)](/guides/cloud-setup-"
"untrusted#rest-untrusted)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Usa la tua chiave API direttamente (ambiente non "
"affidabile)](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#rest-untrusted)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"environment_variable\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"environment_variable\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an environment variable (trusted environment) {#create-an-"
"environment-variable-trusted-environment}"
msgstr ""
"Crea una variabile d'ambiente (ambiente affidabile) {#create-an-environment-"
"variable-trusted-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To set the IQP_API_TOKEN environment variable in your system, you can add "
"the following line to your shell profile (for example, .bashrc or .zshrc) or"
" by setting it directly in your terminal:\n"
msgstr ""
"Per impostare la variabile d'ambiente `IQP_API_TOKEN` nel tuo sistema, puoi "
"aggiungere la riga seguente al profilo della tua shell (ad esempio `.bashrc`"
" o `.zshrc`) oppure impostarla direttamente nel terminale:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```shell\n"
"    export IQP_API_TOKEN=<your-API_KEY> \n"
"    # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved \n"
"    # from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"    When you invoke the environment variable in your code, include `import os`, as in this example:\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```shell\n"
"    export IQP_API_TOKEN=<your-API_KEY> \n"
"    # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved \n"
"    # from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Quando richiami la variabile d'ambiente nel tuo codice, includi `import os`, come in questo esempio:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import os\n"
"    api_token = os.environ['IQP_API_TOKEN']\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Note that when creating an environment variable, your API key is still stored locally in plain text, and should be safeguarded.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import os\n"
"    api_token = os.environ['IQP_API_TOKEN']\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Tieni presente che, quando crei una variabile d'ambiente, la tua chiave API viene comunque salvata localmente in chiaro e deve essere protetta.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Authenticate requests to the Qiskit Runtime REST API by including the CRN "
"and bearer token to the request's headers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Autentica le richieste alla REST API di Qiskit Runtime includendo il CRN e "
"il bearer token negli header della richiesta.\n"

